{"job_id":"F-3e677ecca59b1017f584","family_id":"F-3e677ecca59b1017f584","title":"헌정질서 파괴범죄의 공소시효 등에 관한 특례법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":25,"target_id":"d2030c852905b51562c6eca6dd472613dbe3447e6327087780cc805f7547f17b","source_hash":"805781ce33e010135a0900c1fc7a5da8d3387177059d8024de48028d9eab81b0","text":"关于违反宪法秩序犯罪的诉讼时效等特别法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":115,"target_id":"bb846885e2321f543fc5b73ea4d753af1a79c10364f41fc351cdcab6e2ef2b9f","source_hash":"70463680f18df6b67be382dfc5a31cba31caea7caaa48302a6babc63f795c93b","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过规定有关排除时效等事项，来维护宪法规定的基本自由民主秩序，以惩处旨在破坏宪法存在或摧毁宪法秩序的危害宪法秩序的犯罪行为。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":115,"end":213,"target_id":"5d782a81e9a6e34b2802dbe601c2963552a68d98b3d11b9d6fe64098d14e4b40","source_hash":"c215aff207e8cb88919ff96a41e84813a103cc382f844cc44f987818f54df332","text":"第二条（定义）本法中，“危害宪法秩序的罪行”是指《刑法》第一章第二部分规定的叛乱罪和叛国罪，以及《军事刑法》第二章第二部分规定的暴动罪和叛国罪。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":213,"end":399,"target_id":"d154423bf3cd16314181ce252cccc6d2eaa24ff9022030c169c0cf13dab2c51d","source_hash":"bc81d3157c24f612bdd71987341f90ab17bf464b82743a8995b07e6025e7406d","text":"第三条（诉讼时效的排除）《刑事诉讼法》第249条至第253条和《军事法院法》第291条至第295条规定的诉讼时效不适用于下列各款所列的犯罪。\n1. 根据第2条，危害宪法秩序的犯罪\n2. 根据《防止及惩治灭绝种族罪公约》的定义，构成灭绝种族罪的罪行，即《刑法》第250条规定的罪行\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":399,"end":636,"target_id":"36e4d0d24e6af3669bf8cd7cce9eda15d9cde1df4f08d4484cbdb3505a61af49","source_hash":"54e61cabdcfd781ece90ca913091ab95d3b4a3d799c4ae8325be90c13856a90b","text":"第四条（关于财务审查申请的特别规定）\n① 就第二条所列罪行提起控告或投诉的人，如收到检察机关或军事检察机关的通知，告知其不予起诉，则该人可向检察机关所属的高级检察厅或军事检察机关所属的高级检察部门申请裁定该决定是否适当。<2016年1月6日、2021年9月24日修订>\n② 刑事诉讼法或军事法院法的适用规定适用于第1款规定的复议申请。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":636,"end":680,"target_id":"3c0ae07c7bcd0b8c8d0e08614f17d2ae08ac0add03beed847e0776d2aefe0a0e","source_hash":"bcacd22a8b40c9e56c4ea85fdb82a790e10d3f181a018758543205d9d1fcbb3d","text":"补充规定 <第5028号，1995年12月21日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":680,"end":724,"target_id":"10be996e4ecda0e0666e8ef170395f9cc185381f9a1697e46ee5521af260a34a","source_hash":"3615707bbf9dcaae0fee2b58d67d2f7682896c941001a5298432513a81b3ab84","text":"补充规定 <第10181号，2010年3月24日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":724,"end":754,"target_id":"fb280498f227e0ff5ba3d7b27f74fdc46994b6677c8da715dee969f4d5726efb","source_hash":"77c32786d074314ecad0644c6369d9eaad5941ec97b964bc2f34edf00073013d","text":"补充规定（军事法庭法）<第13722号，2016年1月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":754,"end":804,"target_id":"9d61b2f5de53dbbf9049925b1829606d4514a819ba5b1d0c216f3f3d9d2e85cf","source_hash":"c15f375e75c3a3fa21acdb52d68db6c2b4e2f7f905f4aad278ba67ca1151ebe3","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起一年零六个月后生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":804,"end":821,"target_id":"8233ee49a58860dfeb373ad6bc69cf08b6d3626ea98d31323fad46d8d192a9d4","source_hash":"9c668f5a2d31a12403cc16a9e4f5410caea7fad78df52e49a6877577af85a298","text":"省略第 2 至 8 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":821,"end":964,"target_id":"aabc878d06ce74d4bdb5f3d68352e13abd8d08047f60b11a15df86a3c4ac2576","source_hash":"5b3800e836a974da079527a73422d01332e833d3424cd168e3381041c65831c4","text":"第九条（其他法律的修正）①至⑬ 已省略\n\n  ⑭ 《关于违反宪法秩序犯罪的诉讼时效等特别案件法》部分内容修正如下。 \n\n  在第4条第1款中，“来自检察官”应改为“来自军事检察官”，“检察官”应改为“军事检察官”。\n\n  ⑮ 和 <16> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":964,"end":973,"target_id":"f3186f3c39e5d96d4ba00b677d170740bf124e3f04e5a07d617acfc953ca4f2c","source_hash":"096ca2f054778653faea54e5b71972bca5c5566689631bffec48a45317d41776","text":"第 10 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":973,"end":1004,"target_id":"3e62548a89445c38140b13081dbec83215133f61118bb87f4481c7c2fbd52ecb","source_hash":"3e153683809c72cd0edc0ab230d7a7a14609b5b1accbb9cb01749af8c234076d","text":"补充规定（军事法庭法）<第18465号，2021年9月24日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1004,"end":1039,"target_id":"dd031e198f60ce8fbd0c75ba95709f40dc650e63bc9eff101dffca5a9e437064","source_hash":"e7e8ef155aa811dbfafa88b943c4bab51df61e3e0a6684a1387ec29c7b270342","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2022年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1039,"end":1056,"target_id":"5e8556a3bc5c3acb57836f415a405d7c797b852123e284d501ef55c6e83d6217","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1056,"end":1173,"target_id":"b7c59f6d15f9fb4ee5a3ecfc7ebed21f3de1204613bb5ff3acb0062e762bea01","source_hash":"d31630df18d5f8567f0aa870a831d20609f2b8e2818230bd041ccbb22e73632e","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至⑧ 省略\n\n  ⑨ 关于违反宪法秩序犯罪的诉讼时效等特别案件的法律，现部分修订如下。\n\n  第 4 条第 1 款中的“高等法院或高等军事法院”应改为“高等法院”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001119-235565-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1173,"end":1179,"target_id":"b6c66e5b35782734981203103ee8db769af5a35fd051795264a80c618be1c90a","source_hash":"346dc02866ab4841914a1e396b767652cbb46b187afe667650ccbb16f5e61023","text":"第9条省略"}]}